Subject: [PATCH] feat(memory): opt-in user memory (Memori) + integrations plan

- migration 0003 (user_settings, user_memories; additive); memory OFF by default, signed-in accounts only, nothing inferred
- explicit items only: panel or chat command 'ingat bahwa ...'; 30 x 200 chars; heuristic sensitive-data filter
- injected into the system prompt as data (tags neutralised, ~1500 chars cap) only while enabled
- API /api/memory (+ settings, delete one/all), same-origin for changes, per-user isolation, FK cascade
- missing tables => chat unaffected, memory API 503 memory_unavailable
- UI: Memori panel with Back/Escape handling; docs: FEATURE-TRIAGE updated, INTEGRATIONS-PLAN proposal
- tests: node (real SQLite) + browser
